# Rogue Encampment -> waypoint menu, played right after enter-sp.steps.
# Worked in run:2026-10-11-d2s-waypoints with the smpsor-a/-b saves (tools/d2s.py setwp from
# workspace/samples/d2s/smpsor.d2s) and d2run.py --seed 1: the camp layout is the same for that
# save and seed. The walk goes around Warriv and the camp fire; NPCs wander, so if the last
# screenshot shows no menu, take a shot, find the stone pad and click it by hand.
# Window-relative coordinates for the 800x600 game window (tools/xdrive.py --window "Diablo II").
click 150 380   # walk west, past Warriv
sleep 3
click 700 420   # east, towards the fire
sleep 3
click 620 480
sleep 5
click 250 480   # south-west, to the south wall of the camp
sleep 4
click 790 160   # north-east twice: the waypoint comes into view on the right
sleep 4
click 790 160
sleep 4
click 725 195   # the waypoint pad: the menu opens on the Act I tab
sleep 5
shot workspace/logs/d2s-wp-open-last.png
